  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f56486e487d59bb40569a1e56f9870bb358db51\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f56486e487d59bb40569a1e56f9870bb358db51\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9cab647017010f37ea5bf79e37033c132559a113\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9cab647017010f37ea5bf79e37033c132559a113\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/32e0fda2c10c768bed49fbaacf90b8bab3c865a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/32e0fda2c10c768bed49fbaacf90b8bab3c865a7\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvuoradbv55142ciimo6uhwmo@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvuoradbv55142ciimo6uhwmo/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33209536547&amp;signature=h8%2BOQCCYTLbYeGsgLyDKFSOA2mM%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvuoradbv55142ciimo6uhwmo?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2dW9yYWRidjU1MTQyY2lpbW82dWh3bW8iLCJ0aWQiOiI2M2E5ODAyOS0zZGViLTQ4MWItYmVkZS05YmRlZTc5OGY0M2QiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODM0MTl9.3CEAMZB4iw0N2bASuMxtWAkSdv7KSXsh0cD74ifZTO7cD8Iij3C5eyRRiFMrvSbh1-NBzFnxnXP5tTealKErvg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>중간고사 이후에 학생들과 마음 가볍게 앙금생성반응 실험을 진행했습니다. 다른 선생님께서 구입하셔서 실험하시고 남은 키트를 모아 급하게 보고서 만들고 코팅지 만들어서 진행했는데 책에서 배우지 않은 앙금들도 볼 수 있었습니다. 아이들과 함께 앙금 이름도 생각해보고 화학식도 적어보는 시간을 가졌습니다. 4명 또는 5명이 모둠이 되어(25 또는 26명 정원) 2명은 실험, 1명은 보고서 기록, 1명은 구글프레젠테이션에 실험 결과를 입력하도록 했습니다. 그리고 다음 시간에는 한조씩 나가서 발표를 하고 마지막 5분 정도는 제가 아이들이 몰랐던 앙금을 정리해</p><p>주었습니다. 이론으로 하기보다는 실험을 하고 발표를 통해 아이들이 배워가는 것이 훨씬 많다는 것을 느끼는 활동이었습니다. 혼자서 주도하려고 하지 말고 제발 아이들에게 기회를 주자고 또 한번 다짐하는 시간이었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1R6_BDNrbXXl-eIs7kZCyZmYWP5zgH3hyjBo-_lyxuho/edit#slide=id.g1285bf24158_0_1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1R6_BDNrbXXl-eIs7kZCyZmYWP5zgH3hyjBo-_lyxuho/edit#slide=id.g1285bf24158_0_1</a></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ed564144d7ca36a894bb59e07ed2a7e267b92add?download\" data-file-name=\"[배움활동]Ⅰ_2_2_앙금생성반응으로염화이온확인하기(교).hwp\" data-file-size=\"206848\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D833%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20220516000552&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fed564144d7ca36a894bb59e07ed2a7e267b92add')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[배움활동]Ⅰ_2_2_앙금생성반응으로염화이온확인하기(교)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">202.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/44f14ff3659fa800d355cf21958f30fc51872fe3?download\" data-file-name=\"앙금생성 코팅지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"14848\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D833%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20220516000552&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F44f14ff3659fa800d355cf21958f30fc51872fe3')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">앙금생성 코팅지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">14.50KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
